**/*.bak
architecture/outputs/*.log
architecture/*.log
architecture/**/*.log
architecture/01_Transcriptomics/results/
architecture/02_Proteinomics/results/
architecture/outputs/geo_meta/
architecture/geo_meta/
.git/

# All pipeline data (parquet + celllineselector.db) is fetched from S3 at
# Lambda cold start (see architecture/api/ranking.py's _resolve_data_path,
# DATA_BUCKET env var). Excluding every parquet/db anywhere under
# architecture/ means the image build never depends on what happens to be
# present on the machine running `docker build` -- a fresh clone builds an
# identical image to one on a machine with the full local warehouse.
architecture/**/*.parquet
architecture/**/*.db
